{"seq":1,"slug":"gateway-rate-limiting","title":"网关层限流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/patterns/gateway-rate-limiting","wordCount":1401,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"网关层限流\">网关层限流</h1><p>将限流策略前置到 API 网关或 L7 代理（Envoy、NGINX、Kong）上执行，是生产系统中最高杠杆的限流部署位置。在这一层拦截超限请求，意味着它们永远不会触达应用代码、不会消耗连接池、不会触发数据库查询——一次网关层的拒绝比一次应用层的拒绝节省数十倍的资源。本篇深入网关层限流的实现架构、Envoy Rate Limit Service 的工作机制、以及全局/本地限流的组合策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>网关层限流的核心价值在于&quot;位置优势&quot;——它位于请求路径的最前端（应用代码之前），因此拦截一个请求的成本近乎为零（无需序列化、认证、路由等开销）。同时，网关作为流量的统一入口，天然具备全局视野——一处配置即可覆盖所有下游服务。这使得网关层成为&quot;用最小代价获得最大保护&quot;的部署位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网关层限流的价值定位\">网关层限流的价值定位</h2><p>为什么限流应该在网关层而非应用层执行？以下对比说明了其核心价值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>网关层限流</th>\n<th>应用层限流</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拦截时机</td>\n<td>请求处理前</td>\n<td>业务逻辑入口处</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源消耗</td>\n<td>近乎为零（无序列化/反序列化）</td>\n<td>已消耗认证、路由等开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>策略变更</td>\n<td>配置热更新，无需重部署</td>\n<td>需要代码修改+部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>横切性</td>\n<td>一处配置覆盖所有服务</td>\n<td>每个服务独立实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可见性</td>\n<td>统一的限流指标收集点</td>\n<td>分散在各服务中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精细度</td>\n<td>受限于网关可见的请求元数据</td>\n<td>可基于业务逻辑决策</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：网关层做主力限流（覆盖 80% 场景），应用层做补充（需要业务语义的 20% 场景）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"envoy-rate-limit-service-架构\">Envoy Rate Limit Service 架构</h2><p>Envoy 的限流实现分为两种模式，可以单独使用也可以组合部署：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Envoy Fleet&#10;        E1[Envoy Instance 1]&#10;        E2[Envoy Instance 2]&#10;        E3[Envoy Instance 3]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph Global Rate Limit&#10;        RLS[Rate Limit Service&lt;br/&gt;gRPC 服务]&#10;        REDIS[(Redis)]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    E1 --&gt;|gRPC: ShouldRateLimit| RLS&#10;    E2 --&gt;|gRPC: ShouldRateLimit| RLS&#10;    E3 --&gt;|gRPC: ShouldRateLimit| RLS&#10;    RLS --&gt; REDIS&#10;&#10;    subgraph Local Rate Limit&#10;        E1 --&gt;|内存计数器| L1[Local Token Bucket]&#10;        E2 --&gt;|内存计数器| L2[Local Token Bucket]&#10;        E3 --&gt;|内存计数器| L3[Local Token Bucket]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph Envoy Fleet\n        E1[Envoy Instance 1]\n        E2[Envoy Instance 2]\n        E3[Envoy Instance 3]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Global Rate Limit\n        RLS[Rate Limit Service&lt;br/&gt;gRPC 服务]\n        REDIS[(Redis)]\n    end\n\n    E1 --&gt;|gRPC: ShouldRateLimit| RLS\n    E2 --&gt;|gRPC: ShouldRateLimit| RLS\n    E3 --&gt;|gRPC: ShouldRateLimit| RLS\n    RLS --&gt; REDIS\n\n    subgraph Local Rate Limit\n        E1 --&gt;|内存计数器| L1[Local Token Bucket]\n        E2 --&gt;|内存计数器| L2[Local Token Bucket]\n        E3 --&gt;|内存计数器| L3[Local Token Bucket]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"全局限流-global-rate-limiting\">全局限流（Global Rate Limiting）</h3><p>所有 Envoy 实例共享同一个限流配额——通过外部的 Rate Limit Service（RLS）协调。Envoy Gateway 自动部署和管理这个服务。</p>\n<p><strong>请求流程</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>请求到达 Envoy，匹配路由规则</li>\n<li>Envoy 构建限流描述符（descriptor）——由路由配置中定义的 <code>actions</code> 提取请求属性</li>\n<li>描述符通过 gRPC 发送给 RLS</li>\n<li>RLS 在 Redis 中执行原子计数，返回 ALLOW/DENY</li>\n<li>Envoy 根据结果放行或返回 429</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>描述符示例</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"actions:&#10;  - request_headers:&#10;      header_name: &#39;x-api-key&#39;&#10;      descriptor_key: &#39;api_key&#39;&#10;  - request_headers:&#10;      header_name: &#39;:path&#39;&#10;      descriptor_key: &#39;path&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">actions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">request_headers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      header_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'x-api-key'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      descriptor_key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'api_key'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">request_headers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      header_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">':path'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      descriptor_key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'path'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>生成的描述符：<code>[(&quot;api_key&quot;, &quot;abc123&quot;), (&quot;path&quot;, &quot;/api/v1/users&quot;)]</code></p>\n<p><strong>RLS 规则配置</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"domain: production&#10;descriptors:&#10;  - key: api_key&#10;    descriptors:&#10;      - key: path&#10;        value: &#39;/api/v1/users&#39;&#10;        rate_limit:&#10;          unit: minute&#10;          requests_per_unit: 100&#10;      - key: path&#10;        rate_limit:&#10;          unit: minute&#10;          requests_per_unit: 1000\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">domain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">descriptors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api_key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    descriptors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/v1/users'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        rate_limit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          unit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">minute</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          requests_per_unit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        rate_limit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          unit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">minute</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          requests_per_unit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"本地限流-local-rate-limiting\">本地限流（Local Rate Limiting）</h3><p>每个 Envoy 实例独立执行限流，不依赖外部服务。轻量级但不跨实例共享。</p>\n<p><strong>适用场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>作为全局限流的前置过滤——先本地粗粒度拦截明显的 abuse，减少 RLS 的调用量</li>\n<li>防护突发流量的第一道防线——本地限流延迟为零（内存操作）</li>\n<li>全局 RLS 不可用时的降级方案</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Envoy Gateway 配置示例</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: gateway.envoyproxy.io/v1alpha1&#10;kind: BackendTrafficPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: combined-ratelimit&#10;spec:&#10;  targetRefs:&#10;    - group: gateway.networking.k8s.io&#10;      kind: HTTPRoute&#10;      name: api-routes&#10;  rateLimit:&#10;    local:&#10;      rules:&#10;        - limit:&#10;            requests: 50&#10;            unit: Second&#10;    global:&#10;      rules:&#10;        - limit:&#10;            requests: 10000&#10;            unit: Minute\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">gateway.envoyproxy.io/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">BackendTrafficPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">combined-ratelimit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  targetRefs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">gateway.networking.k8s.io</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">HTTPRoute</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api-routes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  rateLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    local</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">limit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            requests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            unit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Second</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    global</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">limit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            requests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            unit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Minute</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"全局与本地的组合策略\">全局与本地的组合策略</h2><p>组合部署时，请求按顺序经过两层检查：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查顺序</th>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>延迟影响</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>本地</td>\n<td>per-instance</td>\n<td>0ms</td>\n<td>快速拦截明显超限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td>cross-instance</td>\n<td>+1-3ms</td>\n<td>精确的全局配额执行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>关键设计点</strong>：本地限额设为全局限额除以实例数再乘以安全系数（如 1.5x），确保：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单实例不会无限制地放行（即使全局 RLS 故障）</li>\n<li>正常情况下本地不会误杀合法请求（留有余量）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{local} = \\frac{L_{global}}{N_{instances}} \\times 1.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ces</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"nginx-限流实现\">NGINX 限流实现</h2><p>NGINX 的 <code>limit_req</code> 模块实现漏桶算法，<code>limit_conn</code> 模块实现并发限制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nginx\" data-code=\"# 定义限流区域：per-API-key, 10MB 共享内存, 100 req/s&#10;limit_req_zone $http_x_api_key zone=api_limit:10m rate=100r/s;&#10;&#10;# 定义并发限制区域&#10;limit_conn_zone $http_x_api_key zone=api_conn:10m;&#10;&#10;server {&#10;    location /api/ {&#10;        # 漏桶限流: burst=50 允许排队 50 个, nodelay 不延迟&#10;        limit_req zone=api_limit burst=50 nodelay;&#10;        limit_req_status 429;&#10;&#10;        # 并发限制: 同时最多 20 个连接&#10;        limit_conn api_conn 20;&#10;        limit_conn_status 429;&#10;&#10;        # 限流响应头&#10;        add_header X-RateLimit-Limit 100;&#10;        add_header X-RateLimit-Remaining $limit_req_remaining;&#10;&#10;        proxy_pass http://backend;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 定义限流区域：per-API-key, 10MB 共享内存, 100 req/s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>limit_req_zone $http_x_api_key zone=api_limit:10m rate=100r/s;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 定义并发限制区域</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>limit_conn_zone $http_x_api_key zone=api_conn:10m;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>server {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    location /api/ {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        # 漏桶限流: burst=50 允许排队 50 个, nodelay 不延迟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        limit_req zone=api_limit burst=50 nodelay;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        limit_req_status 429;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        # 并发限制: 同时最多 20 个连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        limit_conn api_conn 20;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        limit_conn_status 429;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        # 限流响应头</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        add_header X-RateLimit-Limit 100;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        add_header X-RateLimit-Remaining $limit_req_remaining;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        proxy_pass http://backend;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>NGINX 限流的局限</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>只支持固定速率（漏桶），不支持令牌桶或滑动窗口</li>\n<li>跨实例不共享（每个 NGINX worker 独立的 <code>zone</code>）</li>\n<li>描述符灵活性远低于 Envoy RLS</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"kong-网关的限流插件\">Kong 网关的限流插件</h2><p>Kong 作为 API 网关提供开箱即用的限流插件，支持多种后端存储：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储后端</th>\n<th>一致性</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>local (内存)</td>\n<td>per-instance</td>\n<td>~0ms</td>\n<td>开发/测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cluster (PostgreSQL)</td>\n<td>强一致</td>\n<td>+5-20ms</td>\n<td>小规模生产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>redis</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td>+1-3ms</td>\n<td>大规模生产</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Kong 的优势在于声明式配置（通过 Admin API 或 decK）和与认证插件的深度集成——可以基于 Consumer Group（对应 SaaS 的订阅层级）差异化限流。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边缘限流-cdn-层\">边缘限流：CDN 层</h2><p>Cloudflare、AWS CloudFront 等 CDN 提供的边缘限流在流量进入你的基础设施之前就执行：</p>\n<p><strong>优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>全球分布的 PoP 节点，延迟最低</li>\n<li>抵御 DDoS——恶意流量在边缘就被丢弃</li>\n<li>不消耗你的计算资源</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>局限</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>通常只能基于 IP/ASN/URL 等粗粒度属性</li>\n<li>无法识别认证后的用户身份</li>\n<li>规则灵活性有限（无法做复杂的多维限流）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>最佳实践</strong>：边缘层做 IP 级的粗过滤（如单 IP 不超过 1000 req/min），网关层做认证后的精细限流。两者互补而非替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>网关层是限流的最高杠杆部署位置——拦截越早，节省的资源越多</li>\n<li>Envoy 的全局 + 本地组合策略是当前最灵活的方案</li>\n<li>全局限流通过外部 RLS + Redis 实现跨实例精确配额</li>\n<li>本地限流作为快速前置过滤和降级方案</li>\n<li>CDN 边缘限流是最外层防线，但粒度最粗</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章下一篇 <a href=\"adaptive-concurrency\">自适应并发控制</a> 讨论超越静态限额的动态方案</li>\n<li>API 网关在微服务架构中的整体角色：<a href=\"../../microservices-architecture/microservices-patterns/api-gateway-pattern\">API 网关模式</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网关层限流","id":"网关层限流"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"网关层限流的价值定位","id":"网关层限流的价值定位"},{"level":2,"text":"Envoy Rate Limit Service 架构","id":"envoy-rate-limit-service-架构"},{"level":3,"text":"全局限流（Global Rate Limiting）","id":"全局限流-global-rate-limiting"},{"level":3,"text":"本地限流（Local Rate Limiting）","id":"本地限流-local-rate-limiting"},{"level":2,"text":"全局与本地的组合策略","id":"全局与本地的组合策略"},{"level":2,"text":"NGINX 限流实现","id":"nginx-限流实现"},{"level":2,"text":"Kong 网关的限流插件","id":"kong-网关的限流插件"},{"level":2,"text":"边缘限流：CDN 层","id":"边缘限流-cdn-层"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"多集群同步与跨数据中心限流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/distributed/multi-cluster-sync"},"next":{"title":"自适应并发控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/api-rate-limiting/patterns/adaptive-concurrency"}}